# The target of the Cage's ability is removed in response (CR 608.2b): with its only target illegal the ability does not
# resolve at all, so no counter is put and the "three different powers" check never happens, even though the other
# creatures already have three (Elves 2, Elves 1, Ornithopter 0). On turn 5 a counter goes on one Elves (no offer, powers
# 1 and 2). On turn 7 Bot2 Bolts the second Ornithopter the ability targets: Bot1 is not asked about Mox Ruby (the refused Accept
# holds until Main 2). On turn 9
# the same activation with a legal target leaves powers 3, 1 and 0, so the waiting Accept plays it (the positive control).

